#: ../../source/administration-guide/cloud-workspace-management.rst:2
msgid "Cloud workspace management"
msgstr "클라우드 워크스페이스 관리"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/cloud-workspace-management.rst:4
msgid ""
"This section of the guide is for system admins of Mattermost Cloud "
"deployments."
msgstr ""
"이 가이드 섹션은 Mattermost Cloud 배포의 시스템 관리자를 위한 것입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/cloud-workspace-management.rst:8
msgid ""
"If you're the system admin for a Mattermost self-hosted workspace, see "
"the :doc:`Self-hosted administration </administration-guide/manage/admin"
"/server-maintenance>` documentation."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST 셀프 호스팅 워크스페이스의 시스템 관리자라면 :doc:`셀프 호스팅 관리 "
"</administration-guide/manage/admin/server-maintenance>` 문서를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/cloud-workspace-management.rst:20
msgid ""
":doc:`Workspace migration </administration-guide/manage/cloud-data-"
"export>` - Migrate your workspace using the mmctl tool."
msgstr ""
":doc:`워크스페이스 마이그레이션 </administration-guide/manage/cloud-data-"
"export>` - mmctl 도구를 사용해 워크스페이스를 마이그레이션합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/cloud-workspace-management.rst:21
msgid ""
":doc:`Cloud data residency </administration-guide/manage/cloud-data-"
"residency>` - Find information about your data in the Cloud."
msgstr ""
":doc:`클라우드 데이터 레지던시 </administration-guide/manage/cloud-data-"
"residency>` - 클라우드에 저장된 데이터에 관한 정보를 확인합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/cloud-workspace-management.rst:22
msgid ""
":doc:`Cloud IP Filtering </administration-guide/manage/cloud-ip-"
"filtering>` - Restrict access to your Mattermost Cloud workspace to a "
"specific IP address range."
msgstr ""
":doc:`클라우드 IP 필터링 </administration-guide/manage/cloud-ip-"
"filtering>` - Mattermost Cloud 워크스페이스 접근을 특정 IP 주소 범위로 "
"제한합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/cloud-workspace-management.rst:23
msgid ""
":doc:`Cloud Bring Your Own Key (BYOK) </administration-guide/manage"
"/cloud-byok>` - Learn how to manage data encryption processes within a "
"Mattermost Cloud Enterprise Dedicated deployment."
msgstr ""
":doc:`클라우드 BYOK(Bring Your Own Key) </administration-guide/manage"
"/cloud-byok>` - Mattermost Cloud Enterprise Dedicated 배포 내에서 데이터 "
"암호화 프로세스를 관리하는 방법을 알아봅니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/cloud-workspace-management.rst:25
msgid ""
"`Book a live demo <https://mattermost.com/request-demo/>`_  or `talk to a"
" Mattermost expert <https://mattermost.com/contact-sales/>`_ to explore "
"tailored solutions for your organization's secure collaboration needs. Or"
" try Mattermost yourself with a `1-hour preview <https://mattermost.com"
"/sign-up/>`_ for instant access to a live sandbox environment."
msgstr ""
"`라이브 데모를 예약 <https://mattermost.com/request-demo/>`_\\ 하거나 "
"`Mattermost 전문가와 상담 <https://mattermost.com/contact-sales/>`_\\ 하여 "
"조직의 보안 협업 요구에 맞는 맞춤형 솔루션을 알아보세요. 또는 `1시간 미리보기 "
"<https://mattermost.com/sign-up/>`_\\ 로 라이브 샌드박스 환경에 즉시 "
"접속해 직접 사용해 보세요."

